  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 261
  indentLevel: 2
  storyText: 我虽是久居麟庙之内，但对你也是早有耳闻。不论是外门大比夺得魁首，还是天魔眼为门争光，称得上我离火门的栋梁之材。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114880411685886736}
